  Message:
    Speaker: Silas Thorn
    Text: Listen 'ere, young 'un, this is yer very first lay. Yer'll scuttle off to the cove in the park and nick somethin' worth a mag. Then hop back to me, and I'll think on whether yer fit to join the mob.
